{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"It worries me how deep the tunnels went in London. It seems there are many secrets here we are not aware of.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:06:18.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735316764090695801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"London is a place of many secrets, dark deals, and a tomb for le silenced. But it can also be a hub of getting to know fine people too. It is how I became friends with Archivist Dayson, our Mason friend\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:07:41.943000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735317115820703764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"I do not waste my fear on le, as you say, intangible unknown\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:08:19.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735317273505431625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"The Mason's as well. Who are they. I have spoke with some of their memebers and they seem just as confused as I am.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:09:03.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735317459497779211","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"The Masons believe in seeking knowledge and using it to build sprawling cities and mastering their noble craft. With Roanoke, I am not completely certain of their goals, but It may have to do with the Hunger, or Croatoan\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:11:49.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735318152183021568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
