{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“That’s actually part of the reason why I wanted to talk to you.” They sit next to Cato. “Regarding the Masons, us, and a third group. And how we connect to Roanoke.... and the hunger.”","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:17:27.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735319571451609128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
