{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"He says excitedly","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:20:20.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735320297343025203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"But please, share what is on your mind\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:20:35.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735320358982254612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“I was reading earlier. Looking for anything that could have a connection to the mural I saw, and I learned a bit about Sir Gallahan and Roanoke. The hunger was there, for a start. And I think it might still be there. Waiting.”","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:22:59.023000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-22T02:23:10.847000Z","id":"735320962332885044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
