{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“The colony was led by the eclipse knight, and fought against the monster Croatoan. My reading suggests Croatoan and the Hunger are the same.” They sigh. “I’m boarding the ship to Roanoke soon. I know many Knights are as well. I just want us to be prepared. Our enemy waits, I’m sure of it.”","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:26:14.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735321781195374593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"You will be pleased to know that we have a path to prepare. I will need to get studying but there is hope.\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:27:06.514000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735322000385507359","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
