{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“I found writings in the library that indicated that he was not only a member of our order, but a member of Kairo and the Masons. How is that possible? And if it is the case, why aren’t we all together as one group?”","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:29:47.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735322675853000724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
