{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"Ah, Oui\"\n\nHe twirls the end of his mustache pondering the exact thought","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:30:38.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735322888919449694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"Well, it was through a schism in the Mason order that it began to fall through. In an effort to pool knowledge together, the Masons there bacame the order of Kairo.\n\nIn the years that passed both organizations grew apart from their original ideals. And with the death of his God, the pain Gallahan saw in the forming world caused by the hunger made him strike out to make a new order, one based in the desire for helping others and protecting the divine rather than amassing knowledge for one's self\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:33:42.589000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735323661644464159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"It's not that any are in the wrong, it's just that our once common goal has shifted over time\"","created_at":"2020-07-22T02:35:55.158000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735324217679282258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
